    <string name="privacy_body">Muslim yubaha ubuzima bwite bwawe kandi ntikwegeranya amakuru yawe.\n\n• Nta gukurikirana: nta SDKs z’amatangazo, isesengura canke abakurikirana ivy’ubudandaji.\n• Amakuru aguma ku gikoresho cawe: amakuru yawe yose (aho uri, amasetingi, ibimenyetso) abikwa mu karere ku gikoresho cawe gusa•9000. coordinates zikoreshwa mu kubara ibihe vy’amasengesho na qibla ku gikoresho cawe, kandi ntizigera zirungikwa kuri server iyo ari yo yose yo hanze.\n• Uruhusha gusa iyo bikenewe: dusaba uruhusha (ahantu, amatangazo) gusa iyo ikintu kibikeneye vy’ukuri, n’insobanuro itomoye.\n5• No offline conctivity for app: gukoresha urubuga ni ubusabe bwose ku bindi nk\'ugukuraho amasomo.\n\nIyi politike ni kimwe mu bice vy\'ububiko bw\'inkomoko yuguruye kandi yugururiye gusubirwamwo n\'abanyagihugu.</string>
